{"title": "Immune to Control Undead", "pageid": 11543, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Immune_to_Control_Undead", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp, /w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Immune To Control Undead</b> is a passive feature that prevents this Undead creature from being magically controlled by others. Most noticeable example is the <a href=\"/wiki/Control_Undead\" title=\"Control Undead\">Control Undead</a> oath <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">paladins</a> might have.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature is so powerful, it simply cannot be controlled by the magical whim of others. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a></li></ul>\n</div>     